.TH SEMTIMEDOP 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
semtimedop \- Linux x86-64 syscall 220
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B int semtimedop(int id, struct sembuf* operations, size_t count, const struct timespec* timeout);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Performs an atomic semaphore operation with an optional relative timeout.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR semtimedop (2)
